{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51524","headline":"题惠山寺诗（幷序） 读惠山若冰师诗集因题古院（一作「故园」）五首（前三首《全唐诗》已收） 一 · 李隲","name":"题惠山寺诗（幷序） 读惠山若冰师诗集因题古院（一作「故园」）五首（前三首《全唐诗》已收） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阴阴垂露迹，苔壁几年书。\n种树青松老，传衣白发居。\n字工穷八体，诗律继三闾。\n岂是多年学，真空任性理余。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李隲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51524.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51524","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}